        <span class="cyber-gradient">THAT LAST.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Not systems that impress at first glance,<br/>
        but systems that remain quiet, stable, and correct<br/>
        after the novelty fades.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#work" class="btn btn-primary">
          VIEW SYSTEMS
        </a>
        <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=TcDAyj0AAAAJ&hl=en" 
